5,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. I believe we should look closely at the human element of these projects.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Yay! I want to find out where the money actually goes! I'll look for the hidden costs!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think we should see what actually worked in the past. I don't want us to make a mistake.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,We need to know what's actually stopping the work. I'm tired of hearing about delays after it's too late.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,I agree with the need for practical data. I will focus on the current state of our shared infrastructure.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Sakura, your energy is wonderful. I shall look into the staffing rolls and the minutes on secondments.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Hehe! I'm going to check the travel and bench-fee lines, and the national computing agreement!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I will look at the closeout files of finished awards and the portfolio review of schedule overruns.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I'm checking the incident logs on shared instrumentation and the station records from partner field sites.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,I will examine the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities and the national repository deposit turnaround.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
