30,2,1,talk,Servas,,"It seems we have plenty of coders, but the experts in phenotyping are gone. However, the glasshouse staff are strong.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Oh! Computing is free now, but animal costs are way up! Also, glasshouses are subsidized, but shipping is getting expensive!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,I found that catalogue projects last longer in value... and projects with breeding colonies often run late.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"This is bad. Field sites are getting hit by disasters, and the spectroscopy equipment was broken for weeks because of a contract!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The animal facilities are in great shape now, but the glasshouses are completely full for the next two cycles.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Minako, if the glasshouses are full, that might be a hurdle regardless of the staff strength.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Takumi, that's scary! If the machines are broken, the science stops, right?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"If... if we want something reliable, maybe we should avoid the breeding colonies and the field sites.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"Exactly. We can't trust the field sites right now, and we can't trust the spectroscopy suite to stay running.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Minako,,"We must consider the capacity. If the glasshouses are booked solid, any plant-based research will be delayed.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Servas,,It appears the path of least resistance lies where the staff is available and the facilities are stable.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Sakura,,I wonder if the computing stuff is the safest bet since it's free and the people are there!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,The catalogue-style projects also seemed to be the most successful in the long run.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Takumi,,I'm not betting on anything that needs a field site or a fragile machine.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Minako,,"The animal facility is ready and accredited, which is a strong point for biological studies.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,Servas,,Let us wait for the candidates to see which project fits these realities.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I'm so excited to see who they are!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I just hope we pick one that actually finishes.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,Takumi,,As long as it's not something that'll get stuck in a flooded field.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Minako,,We will apply the facts to the candidates once they are revealed.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
